# 🕵️ SBHunter — Smart Subdomain Hunter

> Modern, fast and user-friendly subdomain discovery tool.
> Passive OSINT + active brute-force + wildcard detection + liveness verification (httpx) — all in one command.

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-blue.svg)](#license) [![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-beta-yellowgreen.svg)](#)

**Quick note:** Use this tool only for authorized tests and learning. Unauthorized scanning is illegal — you alone are responsible for how you use SBHunter.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 🔍 Automatic passive Amass collection
* 🧩 Merge outputs from all tools → `subdomains/*.txt` → unique → `final.txt`
* 🌐 Liveness check: `final.txt` → `httpx` → `final_alive.txt`
* 🧠 Wildcard detection & filtering (removes false positives)
* ⚙️ Built-in fallback dig loop if `puredns`/`dnsx` are missing
* 🎨 `--pretty` for colored, sectioned, human-friendly output
* 🧱 Pipeline continues even if some tools are absent (they are reported)
* 🧰 Supported tools (count: 11): `assetfinder`, `subfinder`, `sublist3r`, `chaos`, `findomain`, `amass`, `dnsx`, `puredns`, `httpx`, `ffuf`, `gobuster`

